\"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932912.000226\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"detail:d4\", \"kind\": \"DETAIL\", \"text\": \"The supplied replies in the tutor’s thread do not provide the requested context or locate the earlier discussion.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790867066.000173\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790920494.000163\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932821.000177\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932874.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932912.000226\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U007\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790867066.000173\", \"role\": \"QA_TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U007\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790920494.000163\", \"role\": \"QA_TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U009\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932821.000177\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U019\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932874.000113\", \"role\": \"QA_TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U001\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932912.000226\", \"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\"}], \"depends_on\": [\"detail:d3\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"detail:d5\", \"kind\": \"DETAIL\", \"text\": \"The September 14 outcome for M10-KO-017 records a different speaker’s quoted casual sentence within polite narration and limits the no-penalty finding to that case.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"k:multi-korean-referral@1.0:929d7cee\", \"k:multi-korean-scoped-result@1.0:5b489480\"], \"depends_on\": [\"summary:s2\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"detail:d6\", \"kind\": \"DETAIL\", \"text\": \"The records retrieved for this run do not identify the requested earlier naturalness or plausible-interpretations discussion.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"k:multi-korean-scoped-result@1.0:5b489480\", \"k:multi-japanese-review-pending@1.0:124c6b92\", \"k:multi-japanese-backup-assignment-deferred@1.0:64536199\", \"k:multi-spanish-audit-schedule-approval@1.0:bba64f57\", \"k:multi-audit-filename-convention-approval@1.0:a5a80940\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790867066.000173\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932821.000177\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U007\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790867066.000173\", \"role\": \"QA_TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U009\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932821.000177\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}], \"depends_on\": [\"summary:s1\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"action\", \"kind\": \"ACTION\", \"text\": \"Ask a language specialist to review. Instruction: Refer the disagreements to language QA and the Korean register report to Korean language QA, sharing the earlier finding’s limits. Draft to copy: Language QA, please assess these reports separately:\\n- A QA tutor reports disagreement on naturalness; a tutor reports disagreement between two plausible interpretations. Please review the exact wording and prompt context. For the tutor’s case, provide the target locale and both explanations before we declare one interpretation authoritative; a QA tutor also asked for the specified audience.\\n- The same QA tutor reports two polite Korean sentences followed by a casual ending. Korean language QA, please review the exact endings, surrounding context, addressee and any quotation. A shift alone does not justify a major penalty.\\nThe earlier M10-KO-017 no-penalty finding concerned a different speaker’s quoted sentence, not a general exemption. Scope: Assess each report separately; the earlier Korean finding does not settle these reports or establish that they concern the same circumstances.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790867066.000173\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790920494.000163\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932821.000177\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932874.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932912.000226\", \"k:multilingual-eval-instructions@1.2:db772378\", \"k:multilingual-eval-instructions@1.2:b26ca59b\", \"k:multilingual-eval-faq@1.1:c080929d\", \"k:multi-korean-referral@1.0:929d7cee\", \"k:multi-korean-scoped-result@1.0:5b489480\", \"k:multi-locale-announcement@1.0:e97783e3\"], \"premises\": [{\"statement_id\": \"claim:c1\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c2\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c3\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c4\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c5\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c6\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c7\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c8\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c10\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\", \"depends_on\": [\"announcement:k:multi-locale-announcement@1.0:e97783e3\"]}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"action:rationale\", \"kind\": \"ACTION_RATIONALE\", \"text\": \"Why this helps: Current guidance calls for context-based language assessment rather than preference alone and specifically directs Korean register cases to Korean language QA.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790867066.000173\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790920494.000163\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932821.000177\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932874.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932912.000226\", \"k:multilingual-eval-instructions@1.2:db772378\", \"k:multilingual-eval-instructions@1.2:b26ca59b\", \"k:multilingual-eval-faq@1.1:c080929d\", \"k:multi-korean-referral@1.0:929d7cee\", \"k:multi-korean-scoped-result@1.0:5b489480\", \"k:multi-locale-announcement@1.0:e97783e3\", \"k:multi-japanese-review-pending@1.0:124c6b92\", \"k:multi-japanese-backup-assignment-deferred@1.0:64536199\", \"k:multi-spanish-audit-schedule-approval@1.0:bba64f57\", \"k:multi-audit-filename-convention-approval@1.0:a5a80940\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"action:need\", \"kind\": \"INTERVENTION_NEED\", \"text\": \"Why intervening now is needed (an operational problem that needs coordination): A QA tutor and a tutor report language-review disagreements without a recorded assessment in their threads, and the QA tutor’s Korean register report also remains unassessed.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790867066.000173\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790920494.000163\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932821.000177\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932912.000226\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"announcement:k:multi-locale-announcement@1.0:e97783e3\", \"kind\": \"ANNOUNCEMENT_HANDLING\", \"text\": \"This announcement applies to this topic and directs current handling: \\\"Provide the exact phrase and prompt context.\\\". The team lead’s announcement applies to multilingual batch 11 and directs collection of wording and context for the locale and register judgments raised here.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"k:multi-locale-announcement@1.0:e97783e3\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"resolution:member_004f98b298cea981137a207f\", \"kind\": \"RESOLUTION\", \"text\": \"Member thread member_004f98b298cea981137a207f is UNRESOLVED: The QA tutor asks for an earlier discussion; the supplied thread has no reply locating it or resolving the naturalness disagreement.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790867066.000173\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"resolution:member_f6c51a875f99468d829d0895\", \"kind\": \"RESOLUTION\", \"text\": \"Member thread member_f6c51a875f99468d829d0895 is UNRESOLVED: The QA tutor reports the Korean register shift and asks for an earlier discussion; the supplied thread contains no reply or assessment.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790920494.000163\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"resolution:member_af8271311d00e91da422309c\", \"kind\": \"RESOLUTION\", \"text\": \"Member thread member_af8271311d00e91da422309c is PARTIALLY_RESOLVED: The team lead supplies the evidence requirement for handling the tutor’s disagreement, but the thread neither locates the earlier discussion nor resolves which interpretation is authoritative.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932821.000177\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932874.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932912.000226\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"severity:rationale\", \"kind\": \"SEVERITY_RATIONALE\", \"text\": \"Severity MEDIUM: The QA tutor’s naturalness disagreement and the tutor’s competing interpretations could change language-quality judgments; the messages do not establish batch-wide disruption.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790867066.000173\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932821.000177\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932912.000226\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790920494.000163\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932874.000113\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"severity:signal:MEDIUM[1]\", \"kind\": \"SEVERITY_SIGNAL\", \"text\": \"Rubric signal met - \\\"Conflicting interpretations that affect, or are reasonably likely to affect, how tasks are scored or handled\\\": A QA tutor reports disagreement over naturalness, and a tutor reports two plausible interpretations; these are competing language-quality judgments requiring context before one interpretation is treated as authoritative.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790867066.000173\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932821.000177\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932912.000226\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"severity:recurrence\", \"kind\": \"HISTORICAL_RECURRENCE\", \"text\": \"Retrieved records show this problem occurred before.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"k:multi-korean-referral@1.0:929d7cee\", \"k:multi-korean-scoped-result@1.0:5b489480\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"severity:reported_recurrence\", \"kind\": \"REPORTED_RECURRENCE\", \"text\": \"Members report that this is happening again (their report; not corroborated history).\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790867066.000173\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790920494.000163\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790932821.000177\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"reporter:U007\", \"kind\": \"AFFECTED_REPORTER\", \"text\": \"U007 reports, in their own cited message, being affected by this problem.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_